Bundled third-party code
========================

src/vendor/gumbo/
-----------------

This directory vendors the parser library of the Gumbo HTML5 parser,
version 0.14.0, from the maintained fork at
https://codeberg.org/gumbo-parser/gumbo-parser. The release, the commit it
resolves to, the archive checksum and the import date are recorded in
src/vendor/PROVENANCE.

